<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period March 24-30 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	     March 24-30  March 25-31     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    381,233.2   407,595.8</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  10,641.7     7,461.3     876,142.1    712,926.3</p>
<p> Home Market	  319.2	 320.5	12,712.8     14,616.7</p>
<p> Stocks/close   370,272.3   399,814.0</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
